Infra guard 1.2.0 (infra-guard) by Ada
Keeps agents off production.
Provides: code · tools · rules · guard

It may:
  • reads your projects
  • offers tools to agents
Claude threads get its tools only while the Agent mod is on (early
access, off by default: Settings, Agent mod, or [agent_mod] enabled =
true).

Rules it adds for every thread, rules.md, in full:
----- begin rules.md -----
Never touch prod.
----- end rules.md -----
Tool it offers your threads and coordinators (they read its description)
, infra-guard_prod_status, in full:
----- begin infra-guard_prod_status -----
Says whether production is frozen.
Input: none
----- end infra-guard_prod_status -----
Guard rule it adds for your threads and coordinators (it only refuses; t
hey read its message), mod:infra-guard.no-destroy, in full:
----- begin mod:infra-guard.no-destroy -----
Refuses the commands: terraform destroy
Message: Infrastructure is the human's to change.
----- end mod:infra-guard.no-destroy -----

From /home/ada/mods/infra-guard. It installs off: tm asks next whether
to turn it on.
Install Infra guard?
